
Networking and data
───────────────────
  off appstatus                    Turn away old versions, announce downtime
      brings in network
  on  coil                         Load images from URLs
  off database                     Keep the app's own data on the device
  on  network                      Talk to a REST API
  off offlinequeue                 Send what was written offline
      brings in database, network
  off paging                       An endless feed that loads as you scroll
      brings in network
  off websocket                    Keep a live connection open
      brings in network

Sign-in and account
───────────────────
  off applock                      Ask for a fingerprint on return
      brings in settings
  off auth                         Sign in, sign up, reset password
      brings in forms, network
  off googlesignin                 Continue with Google
      brings in auth, forms, network
  off profile                      A profile tab with a photo

Screens
───────
  off forms                        Validate forms properly
  off language                     Let people pick the app's language
      brings in settings
  off licenses                     Show the licences you have to show
      brings in settings
  off onboarding                   A first-run walkthrough
  off sample                       A working screen to learn from
      brings in network
  off search                       Search as you type
      brings in network
  off settings                     A settings screen

Platform
────────
  off browser                      Open web pages without leaving the app
  on  deeplink                     Open the app from a link
  off media                        Pick, take and shrink photos
  off playstore                    Offer updates and ask for ratings
  off push                         Receive push notifications
      brings in firebase

Observability
─────────────
  off analytics                    Track events and crashes, vendor-free
  off crashlytics                  Send crashes to Firebase
      brings in analytics, firebase
  off devtools                     See every request the app made
  off firebaseanalytics            Send analytics to Firebase
      brings in analytics, firebase
  off flags                        Turn a feature on without shipping
  on  perfhud                      FPS, jank, graphs and a score beside the DEV badge
      brings in devtools
  off remoteconfig                 Change feature flags from the console
      brings in firebase, flags

Design
──────
  on  catalog                      A second app showing every component
  off collections                  Carousels, drag to reorder, zoomable images
  off datadisplay                  Show numbers, charts and tables
  off formfields                   Fields for codes, money and more
  on  googlefonts                  Use any Google Font
  off liquidglass                  Glass tiers, a backdrop and a lens to build glass chrome on; nothing uses them yet
  off pickers                      Pick dates and times inline

Build and quality
─────────────────
  on  ci                           Build and test every push on GitHub
  off coverage                     Fail a build that drops coverage
  off depsanalysis                 See which dependencies nobody uses
  off formatting                   One code style, checked on every build
  on  leakcanary                   Find memory leaks in debug builds
  off performance                  Measure smoothness on a real phone

Option: No UI components
────────────────────────
  ui_components                Setup only: the architecture, every build guard and a theme skeleton, without UI components
      on by default; --set ui_components=false to tick it
      leaves out catalog: The catalog app shows the design system's components, and this project has none.
      leaves out collections: Carousels, reorderable lists and the image viewer are components; build yours on the theme skeleton.
      leaves out datadisplay: Stat tiles, charts and tables are components; build yours on the theme skeleton.
      leaves out formfields: Code, money and phone fields are components; form state and validation (forms) stay.
      leaves out pickers: Calendars and wheel pickers are components; build yours on the theme skeleton.
      leaves out liquidglass: Glass is drawn by components and the shell, which this project leaves to your design system.
      describes appstatus, coil, database, paging, applock, auth, googlesignin, profile, language, licenses, onboarding, sample, search, settings, browser, deeplink, media, playstore, push, firebaseanalytics, performance differently; --no-ui-components lists them that way

  44 features. Presets: lean, standard, everything.

